PyCountdown is a desktop application that shows many countdown timers and clocks at once: absolute clocks in several time scales (UTC, TAI, GPS time), time zone clocks, and timers linked to one another.

Display formats can be customized, thresholds change a clock's color and sound an alert, and the set of clocks is kept in a JSON file.

